# CanonicalStateWriterReferenceVectors.json is the determinism pin of 14 §16.6 and
# SnapshotFieldOrder.json is the field-order pin it is keyed to. Both are re-asserted on
# Linux x64, Android ARM64 and iOS ARM64 by the cross-platform job (M5-12). Their line
# endings are pinned to LF so the files are byte-identical on every one of them, and so a
# one-row addition never diffs as a whole-file rewrite because someone's core.autocrlf
# disagreed. Same rule as Rng/ and SlayIdleRepeat.Data/.
*.json text eol=lf
